Nothing spectacular.  I've ascended about 10 characters in my Nethack
career including wishless, polyless, and genoless.  Recently I've been
sloppy / cocky and haven't ascended anyone for a while.  This is my
first tournament so I just wanted one ascension.

After a few randomly chosen character deaths that all died prior to the 
bottom of Gnomish Mines Blantathore was manifested as a chaotic human
barbarian.  He found a wand of wishing in the top half of Gnomish Mines
which was not identified until mine town.  Minetown was a bones file
whose only useful feature was a magic marker.  This was the only bones
file I found the whole game.  Wished for 2x?oC, SDSM, CoMR, "oLS, and
two failed artifact attempts at Orb of Fate and . . . I forget the other
one.  I couldn't pick them up which made me sad.  A few levels down
yielded a Magic Lamp which I kept for light the entire game (never found
another)

Finished the mines, Socoban had a BOH.  BoSpeed came shortly
thereafter.  Converted an alter, started Enchanting my armor, got
Cleaver.  Passed up my quest.  Ran into a Lich, wrote ?oG and smoked his
kind while staring into his eyes - he dropped an Athame which was
useful.  Genocided both mindflyers while I was at it.

Medusa was the Titan which was no big problem.  Once killing the Titan I
went Ludios hunting - found it - plundered it.  Then Quest - I didn't
have a magic whistle so the Ts were more annoying than normal (didn't
get a Magic Whistle until VotD).  Took all my winnings to an alter for
identification and enchantment.  Polypiled for an "oLS, /oD, and MM.
Bought protection to 0AC naked.

Levitated to Medusa's island.  Found a statue of myself!  (I wanted to
take part in a rescue mission and bring my petrified self to the
surface for proper medical treatment - but I was unable to even lift
myself without dropping stuff so I gave up on that idea).  Perseus was
empty.  Stormed the Castle from the back.  Trollsbane was in the armory.
Wished for MM, Gaunt of Power, /oD, T-shirt.  I enchanted my t-shirt
till it evaporated and wished for a replacement (I had wishes to burn)

I thought that VotD was a bones file at first.  I just looked . . .
different.  But I found no stash so I guess not.  

I put boulders over the stairs of any demon prince levels and ousted
them with no major incident (after chasing Orcus up like 10 flights of
stairs one time I always use boulders).  Killed Vlad.  Found the Tower
portal.  Found the Vibrating Square.  Level Teleported to level 1 where
I dropped off some /oDig, /oTele, ?oGD.  Went down the dungeon floor by
floor detecting treasure with potions in search for gems.  Bought
candles in minetown.  When I reached Orcus again I mixed and blessed
potions to up my HP.  I realized about this time that I hadn't had a
lizard corpse in my main inventory for quite some time - glad I never
ran into a difficult situation in Gehenom.

Rodney double troubled me.  I didn't have "oMB so I had to be careful
not to kill him over water.  Did the song and dance at Vibe Square.  Ran
into little resistance.  Snagged the Amulet.  The magical force was
quite obnoxious.  Thought that chaotic characters were supposed to have
an easy time :/.  When Rodney showed up I /oDed him before he could
summon anything bad.  

At Dlvl1 I checked my inventory my typical 20
times before going up the stairs.  Earth was cake.  Air was surprisingly
difficult.  I lost track of the portal so I had to use a second ?oGD.
Air Elementals caused me to use two !oFH.  Fire was no problem.  I had
to rewrite a ?oGD for water and it took forever to be in the same bubble
as the portal.  No matter.  My Angel and I headed right.  Grabbed
frostbrand from a player-monster.  /oDeathed big guys and /oT little
guys/immune beasts.  Pestilence made me ill which only served to upset
me.

I got confused at the alter.  The only way I know to identify the
alignment of the alter is to stand on it, step off of it, and then [?.]
it.  It said "aligned alter".  I thought it was supposed to say choatic,
neutral, or lawful but it just said "aligned".  I figured I was mistaken
and for the top three it would simply be "aligned" or "unaligned".  So a
sacrificed the Amulet.  Set was very disappointed in me but [whomever]
allowed me to exit with my angel and all my beautiful gems.  Who am I to
complain?

So I guess I didn't ascend.  I had plenty of /oD, "oLS, and !oFH so I'm
sure I could have made it to the correct alter if I'd understood the
game message correctly.

All in all.  A pretty mundane and uneventful game.
Long live Blantathore!

